            0.126
          ],
          "content": "(i) Identify the separation technique marked as ‘S’."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.125,
            0.468,
            0.142
          ],
          "content": "(ii) Label the apparatus A, B and C."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.144,
            0.142,
            0.634,
            0.194
          ],
          "content": "(iii) Which of the following mixtures can be separated by the technique identified above? Use the data given in Table 5.5. Mixtures:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.188,
            0.197,
